---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Blog
section: blog
permalink: /blog/index.html
eyebrow: Notes & perspectives
intro: Thinking out loud about research, learning, and academic life.
description: Research notes and perspectives by Shao-Yuan Lo.
---
<div class="post-list">
  {% for post in collections.writing %}
  <article class="post-preview">
    <div class="post-preview-meta"><time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | dateLabel }}</time><span>{{ post.data.category or 'Research notes' }}{% if post.data.example %} · Example{% endif %}</span></div>
    <h2><a href="{{ post.url | url }}">{{ post.data.title }} {% include 'partials/arrow.njk' %}</a></h2>
    <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
    <a class="text-link" href="{{ post.url | url }}">Read article <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  </article>
  {% else %}
  <p>New writing is on its way. Check back for research notes and updates.</p>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
